#: src/pages.py:1039
msgid "Advanced — keep existing systems"
msgstr "Avanceret — behold eksisterende systemer"

#: src/pages.py:1041
msgid "Use already-unallocated space and preserve existing partitions. This is the only Windows coexistence path."
msgstr "Bruk allerede udelt plads og bevare eksisterende partitioner. Dette er den eneste Windows-samlevingsvej."

#: src/pages.py:1089
msgid "Advanced coexistence can affect EFI firmware state and may trigger BitLocker recovery. It never shrinks or repairs Windows volumes."
msgstr "Avanceret samexistens kan påvirke EFI-firmwaretilstanden og kan udløse BitLocker-gendannelse. Den krymper eller reparerer aldrig Windows-volumener."

#: src/pages.py:1099
#, python-brace-format
msgid "ALL DATA on {disk} will be permanently erased."
msgstr "ALLE DATA på {disk} vil blive permanent slettet."

#: src/pages.py:1135
msgid "This disk is too small for whole-disk installation. Advanced may continue only if suitable unallocated space exists."
msgstr "Disken er for lille til en fuld disk-installation. Avanceret kan kun fortsætte, hvis der findes egnet tildelt plads."

#: src/pages.py:1145
msgid "Existing partitions were detected. The first two choices delete them; Advanced is the preservation path."
msgstr "Eksisterende partitioner blev detekteret. De to første valg sletter dem; Avanceret er vejen til bevaring."

#: src/pages.py:1178
msgid "Advanced Storage"
msgstr "Avanceret lager"

#: src/pages.py:1183
msgid "Advanced: Install Alongside"
msgstr "Avanceret: Installer side om side"

#: src/pages.py:1212
msgid "Before continuing: finish Windows updates, disable Fast Startup and hibernation, and back up the BitLocker recovery key. EFI, Secure Boot, TPM measurements and boot order can change."
msgstr "Før du fortsætter: afslut Windows-opdateringer, deaktiver Hurtig start og hviletilstand, og sikkerhedskopier BitLocker-gendannelsesnøglen. EFI, Sikker opstart, TPM-målinger og startsekvens kan ændres."

#: src/pages.py:1219
msgid "This advanced path preserves existing partitions but changes the selected disk's partition table and the machine's EFI boot state."
msgstr "Denne avancerede sti bevarer eksisterende partitioner, men ændrer den valgte disks partitionstabel og maskinens EFI-boot-tilstand."

